## Review Process

### Architecture Review
1. Design validation
2. Security assessment
3. Performance review
4. Scalability testing
5. Integration verification
6. Documentation review
7. Final approval

### Code Review
1. Standards compliance
2. Security analysis
3. Performance check
4. Test coverage
5. Documentation quality
6. Maintainability assessment
7. Final validation

